IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- Telecommunications Act 1999 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation (TA1999.txt).
-- PART 4 CODES OF PRACTICE, STANDARDS OF PERFORMANCE, DIRECTIONS AND ADVISORY GUIDELINES ON TELECOMMUNICATIONS: ss 30 to 32.
-- Seat: the telecommunication licensee (the person the code or direction binds) and the person whose information the code lets a licensee use.
-- 2000 Revised Edition numbers: s 30 was s 26, s 31 was s 27, s 32 was s 28.  Codes under s 30 are the "codes of practice" that s 5(2)(d) and s 10(1)(b) speak of.

§ `s 30 Codes of practice and standards of performance on telecommunications`

-- src:2352 | 30.—(1) The Authority may, from time to time —
-- src:2354 | (a) issue one or more codes of practice or standards of
-- src:2355 | performance;
-- src:2357 | (b) approve as a code of practice or standard of performance
-- src:2358 | any document prepared by a person other than the
-- src:2359 | Authority, if the Authority considers the document to be
-- src:2360 | suitable for this purpose; or
-- src:2362 | (c) review, amend or revoke any code of practice or standard
-- src:2363 | of performance issued under paragraph (a) or approved
-- src:2364 | under paragraph (b),
-- src:2366 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2367 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 48
-- src:2369 | with respect to all or any of the following:
-- src:2371 | (d) the operation of telecommunication systems and
-- src:2372 | equipment;
-- src:2374 | (e) the provision of telecommunication services;
-- src:2376 | (f) the activities and conduct of telecommunication licensees
-- src:2377 | in the provision of telecommunication services;
-- src:2379 | (g) the provision of services relating to the use of, or access to,
-- src:2380 | telecommunication systems;
-- src:2382 | (h) the activities and conduct of telecommunication licensees
-- src:2383 | in the provision of services relating to the use of, or access
-- src:2384 | to, telecommunication systems;
-- src:2386 | (i) competition, abuse of a dominant position in the market
-- src:2387 | and fair market conduct in the telecommunication industry
-- src:2388 | in Singapore;
-- src:2390 | (j) the acquisitions or consolidations involving a
-- src:2391 | telecommunication licensee and any other person
-- src:2392 | (whether a telecommunication licensee or otherwise);
-- src:2394 | (k) the collection, use and disclosure by telecommunication
-- src:2395 | licensees of information about subscribers of
-- src:2396 | telecommunication services, without the subscribers’
-- src:2397 | consent, including information about the subscribers’
-- src:2398 | personal data, telecommunication subscription and usage;
-- src:2400 | (l) the carrying out of the purposes and provisions of this Act
-- src:2401 | and the due administration thereof.
@ref s 30(1) (src:2352-2401)
GIVEN `the Authority issues a code of practice or standard of performance, approves as one a document prepared by another person that it considers suitable, or reviews, amends or revokes one` IS A BOOLEAN
      subject IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(1): the Authority may act under paragraphs (a) to (c) with respect to this subject` MEANS
    `the Authority issues a code of practice or standard of performance, approves as one a document prepared by another person that it considers suitable, or reviews, amends or revokes one`
    AND elem subject (LIST "the operation of telecommunication systems and equipment"
                          , "the provision of telecommunication services"
                          , "the activities and conduct of telecommunication licensees in the provision of telecommunication services"
                          , "the provision of services relating to the use of, or access to, telecommunication systems"
                          , "the activities and conduct of telecommunication licensees in the provision of services relating to the use of, or access to, telecommunication systems"
                          , "competition, abuse of a dominant position in the market and fair market conduct in the telecommunication industry in Singapore"
                          , "the acquisitions or consolidations involving a telecommunication licensee and any other person"
                          , "the collection, use and disclosure by telecommunication licensees of information about subscribers of telecommunication services, without the subscribers' consent, including information about the subscribers' personal data, telecommunication subscription and usage"
                          , "the carrying out of the purposes and provisions of this Act and the due administration thereof")

-- src:2405 | (2) A code of practice issued or approved under subsection (1) may,
-- src:2406 | in particular —
-- src:2408 | (a) specify the duties and obligations of any person in relation
-- src:2409 | to the person’s business operation in the
-- src:2410 | telecommunication industry; and
-- src:2412 | (b) provide for such fees and charges as may be payable to the
-- src:2413 | Authority in relation to any application or request made to
-- src:2414 | the Authority under the code of practice.
@ref s 30(2) (src:2405-2414)
GIVEN `it specifies the duties and obligations of a person in relation to the person's business operation in the telecommunication industry` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it provides for fees and charges payable to the Authority in relation to an application or request made to the Authority under the code of practice` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(2): the code of practice issued or approved under subsection (1) may contain this` MEANS
    `it specifies the duties and obligations of a person in relation to the person's business operation in the telecommunication industry` OR `it provides for fees and charges payable to the Authority in relation to an application or request made to the Authority under the code of practice`

-- src:2421 | (3) If any provision in any code of practice or standard of
-- src:2422 | performance issued or approved under subsection (1) is
-- src:2423 | inconsistent with any provision of this Act, that provision in that
-- src:2424 | code of practice or standard of performance, to the extent of the
-- src:2425 | inconsistency —
-- src:2427 | (a) has effect subject to the provisions of this Act; or
-- src:2429 | (b) having regard to the provisions of this Act, does not have
-- src:2430 | effect.
@ref s 30(3) (src:2421-2430)
GIVEN `a provision of the code of practice or standard of performance is inconsistent with a provision of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(3): the code provision has effect only subject to the Act, or has no effect, to the extent of the inconsistency` MEANS
    `a provision of the code of practice or standard of performance is inconsistent with a provision of this Act`

-- src:2434 | (4) A code of practice or standard of performance issued or
-- src:2435 | approved under subsection (1) does not have legislative effect.
@ref s 30(4) (src:2434-2435)
GIVEN `the code of practice or standard of performance was issued or approved under subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(4): the code of practice or standard of performance has legislative effect` MEANS
    FALSE

-- src:2439 | (5) Subject to subsection (6), every telecommunication licensee to
-- src:2440 | whom any code of practice or standard of performance issued or
-- src:2441 | approved under subsection (1) applies must comply with that code of
-- src:2442 | practice or standard of performance.
@ref s 30(5) (src:2439-2442)
GIVEN `the code of practice or standard of performance issued or approved under subsection (1) applies to the telecommunication licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority waived its application under subsection (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(5): the telecommunication licensee must comply with the code of practice or standard of performance` MEANS
    `the code of practice or standard of performance issued or approved under subsection (1) applies to the telecommunication licensee` AND (NOT `the Authority waived its application under subsection (6)`)

-- src:2446 | (6) The Authority may, either generally or for such time as the
-- src:2447 | Authority may specify, waive the application, to any
-- src:2448 | telecommunication licensee, of any code of practice or standard of
-- src:2449 | performance issued or approved under subsection (1) or of any part of
-- src:2450 | any such code of practice or standard of performance.
@ref s 30(6) (src:2446-2450)
GIVEN `the Authority waived the application, generally or for such time as it specified, of the code or standard or of part of it, to the telecommunication licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 30(6): the waiver has effect` MEANS
    `the Authority waived the application, generally or for such time as it specified, of the code or standard or of part of it, to the telecommunication licensee`

§ `s 31 Directions affecting telecommunication licensees`

-- src:2458 | 31.—(1) The Authority may give directions to be observed by
-- src:2459 | telecommunication licensees —
-- src:2461 | (a) to ensure the reliability of the provision of any
-- src:2462 | telecommunication service to the public;
-- src:2464 | (b) to ensure the technical compatibility and safety of
-- src:2465 | operation of any equipment or telecommunication system;
-- src:2467 | (c) to ensure fair and efficient market conduct by
-- src:2468 | telecommunication licensees;
-- src:2470 | (d) to ensure the coordination and cooperation, on such terms
-- src:2471 | as the Authority may specify, with any other person in the
-- src:2473 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2474 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 50
-- src:2476 | use or sharing of any installation, plant or system (or part
-- src:2477 | of it) owned or used by the telecommunication licensee for
-- src:2478 | the provision of any telecommunication service; or
-- src:2480 | (e) in the public interest.
@ref s 31(1) (src:2458-2480)
GIVEN purpose IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(1): the Authority may give directions to be observed by telecommunication licensees for this purpose` MEANS
    elem purpose (LIST "to ensure the reliability of the provision of any telecommunication service to the public"
                      , "to ensure the technical compatibility and safety of operation of any equipment or telecommunication system"
                      , "to ensure fair and efficient market conduct by telecommunication licensees"
                      , "to ensure the coordination and cooperation, on such terms as the Authority may specify, with any other person in the use or sharing of any installation, plant or system owned or used by the telecommunication licensee for the provision of any telecommunication service"
                      , "in the public interest")

-- src:2484 | (2) The Authority may give directions to be observed by
-- src:2485 | telecommunication licensees —
-- src:2487 | (a) to ensure the reliability of the provision of any
-- src:2488 | broadcasting service, the operation of which requires a
-- src:2489 | telecommunication system, to the public;
-- src:2491 | (b) to ensure the technical compatibility and safety of
-- src:2492 | operation of any equipment or telecommunication
-- src:2493 | system used for the provision of any broadcasting service;
-- src:2495 | (c) to ensure fair and efficient market conduct by
-- src:2496 | telecommunication licensees in relation to the use of
-- src:2497 | telecommunication systems for the provision of
-- src:2498 | broadcasting services;
-- src:2500 | (d) to ensure the coordination and cooperation, on such terms
-- src:2501 | as the Authority may specify, with any other person in the
-- src:2502 | use or sharing of any installation, plant or system (or part
-- src:2503 | of it) owned or used by the telecommunication licensee for
-- src:2504 | the provision of any broadcasting service; or
-- src:2506 | (e) in relation to the provision of any broadcasting service, the
-- src:2507 | operation of which requires a telecommunication system,
-- src:2508 | in the public interest.
@ref s 31(2) (src:2484-2508)
GIVEN purpose IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(2): the Authority may give directions to be observed by telecommunication licensees for this purpose, in relation to broadcasting services requiring a telecommunication system` MEANS
    elem purpose (LIST "to ensure the reliability of the provision of any broadcasting service, the operation of which requires a telecommunication system, to the public"
                      , "to ensure the technical compatibility and safety of operation of any equipment or telecommunication system used for the provision of any broadcasting service"
                      , "to ensure fair and efficient market conduct by telecommunication licensees in relation to the use of telecommunication systems for the provision of broadcasting services"
                      , "to ensure the coordination and cooperation, on such terms as the Authority may specify, with any other person in the use or sharing of any installation, plant or system owned or used by the telecommunication licensee for the provision of any broadcasting service"
                      , "in relation to the provision of any broadcasting service, the operation of which requires a telecommunication system, in the public interest")

-- src:2512 | (3) A direction under subsection (1) or (2) —
-- src:2514 | (a) may require the telecommunication licensee concerned
-- src:2515 | (according to the circumstances of the case) to do, or to
-- src:2516 | refrain from doing, such things as are specified in the
-- src:2517 | direction, or as are of a description specified in the
-- src:2518 | direction; and
-- src:2520 | (b) takes effect at such time (being the earliest practicable
-- src:2521 | time) as is determined by or under that direction.
@ref s 31(3) (src:2512-2521)
GIVEN `the thing is specified in the direction or is of a description specified in the direction` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(3)(a): the direction may require the licensee to do, or to refrain from doing, the thing` MEANS
    `the thing is specified in the direction or is of a description specified in the direction`

GIVEN `the time is the earliest practicable time determined by or under the direction` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(3)(b): the direction takes effect at this time` MEANS
    `the time is the earliest practicable time determined by or under the direction`

-- src:2528 | (4) The Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke the
-- src:2529 | whole or any part of a direction under subsection (1) or (2).
@ref s 31(4) (src:2528-2529)
GIVEN `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes the whole or any part of a direction under subsection (1) or (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(4): the Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke the direction` MEANS
    `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes the whole or any part of a direction under subsection (1) or (2)`

-- src:2533 | (5) Before giving a direction to any telecommunication licensee
-- src:2534 | under subsection (1) or (2) or varying a direction under
-- src:2535 | subsection (4), the Authority must, unless the Authority in respect
-- src:2536 | of any particular direction considers that it is not practicable or
-- src:2537 | desirable, give notice —
-- src:2539 | (a) stating that the Authority proposes to make or vary the
-- src:2540 | direction and setting out its effect; and
-- src:2542 | (b) specifying the time within which representations or
-- src:2543 | objections to the proposed direction or variation may be
-- src:2544 | made,
-- src:2546 | and must consider any representations or objections which are duly
-- src:2547 | made.
@ref s 31(5) (src:2533-2547)
GIVEN `the Authority considers that giving notice is not practicable or desirable in respect of the particular direction` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority gave notice stating that it proposes to make or vary the direction and setting out its effect, and specifying the time within which representations or objections may be made` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority considered the representations or objections duly made` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(5): the Authority has done what it must do before giving or varying the direction` MEANS
    `the Authority considers that giving notice is not practicable or desirable in respect of the particular direction` OR (`the Authority gave notice stating that it proposes to make or vary the direction and setting out its effect, and specifying the time within which representations or objections may be made` AND `the Authority considered the representations or objections duly made`)

-- src:2551 | (6) Every telecommunication licensee must comply with every
-- src:2552 | direction of the Authority given to the licensee under this section.
@ref s 31(6) (src:2551-2552)
GIVEN `the Authority gave the direction to the licensee under section 31` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 31(6): the telecommunication licensee must comply with the direction` MEANS
    `the Authority gave the direction to the licensee under section 31`

§ `s 32 Advisory guidelines`

-- src:2557 | 32.—(1) The Authority may make written advisory guidelines
-- src:2559 | about any aspect of telecommunications.
-- src:2560 | (2) Advisory guidelines, for example, may be made about —
-- src:2561 | (a) any matter in respect of which codes of practice and
-- src:2562 | standards of performance may be made under section 30;
-- src:2563 | (b) the use, construction, design or performance of anything;
-- src:2564 | (c) interference with radio-communications; or
-- src:2565 | (d) frequency allocation and coordination.
@ref s 32(1) and (2) (src:2557-2565)
GIVEN `the guideline is written` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is about an aspect of telecommunications` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 32(1): the Authority may make the advisory guideline` MEANS
    `the guideline is written` AND `it is about an aspect of telecommunications`

GIVEN example IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 32(2): advisory guidelines may, for example, be made about this matter` MEANS
    elem example (LIST "any matter in respect of which codes of practice and standards of performance may be made under section 30"
                      , "the use, construction, design or performance of anything"
                      , "interference with radio-communications"
                      , "frequency allocation and coordination")

-- src:2566 | (3) The Authority must —
-- src:2567 | (a) give a copy of each advisory guideline it makes to the
-- src:2568 | Minister; and
-- src:2570 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2571 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 52
-- src:2573 | (b) publish each advisory guideline in the way it thinks fit.
@ref s 32(3) (src:2566-2573)
GIVEN `the Authority gave a copy of the advisory guideline to the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority published the advisory guideline in the way it thinks fit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 32(3): the Authority has done what it must do with the advisory guideline` MEANS
    `the Authority gave a copy of the advisory guideline to the Minister` AND `the Authority published the advisory guideline in the way it thinks fit`
